          "quote": "1. 目前医生没有把病灶当“浸润性乳腺癌”去处理，也没让马上二次扩大手术或放化疗，说明病理倾向良性/低度病变可能性大。2. 后续重点只剩“伤口恢复 + 3–6个月乳腺超声复查”这一条线。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00292",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave a clear list of what is still unknown and what to ask at the next appointment, closing the episode with a safe, bounded plan.",
          "quote": "后续重点只剩“伤口恢复 + 3–6个月乳腺超声复查”这一条线；只要伤口没感染、血肿，就按计划去医院换药、拆线，然后按时回门诊做超声即可。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "At closure, the doctor clearly stated what was resolved (the plan for the 4B and the benign/low-grade pathology direction) and what still needed to be confirmed (final pathology, margins, exact C-TIRADS), and gave a pre-appointment checklist.",
